# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Usage:  $(t "English text")
#         $(t "Text with a \${variable} inside")   <- note the escaped \$
# The English text is the dictionary key, so it must reach t() exactly as
# it is written in this file. Variables must therefore be escaped (\$VAR or
