# in, from the caller's variables. A translation whose variables or printf
# markers (%s) do not match the original is ignored (English is shown).
# Dictionaries: lang/<code>.cache, lines "base64(english)|base64(translation)",
# generated by gen_all_langs.py.
# ======================================================================
